d80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"observation following Theorem 5.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof scope and outstanding obligations in Remark"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是固定 PR 呈示且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为标准算术模型，公式类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_1}(\\pi,T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\pi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T\\cup\\{\\pi\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_1}(\\pi,T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\pi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T\\cup\\{\\pi\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷62页/PDF73页定理1后的观察。已核对短证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 真而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\pi\\vdash\\sigma\">\\(T+\\pi\\vdash\\sigma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg\\pi\\lor\\sigma\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg\\pi\\lor\\sigma\\)</span>；该句是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>，由可靠性为真，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 真，由 Q 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\sigma\">\\(T\\vdash\\sigma\\)</span>。同理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\neg\\pi\">\\(T\\nvdash\\neg\\pi\\)</span>，从而扩张一致。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 假，Q 证明真的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\pi\">\\(\\neg\\pi\\)</span>，扩张不一致，也不能对一致的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 保守。</p>\n<p>本地论证已人工核对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 正规化与完备性的统一算术化仍依赖原书基础接口，未作机器验证或独立重建，故保持受限依赖标记。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"re