lse},{"tex":"T\\nvdash\\neg\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":2268,"backlinks":[{"id":"675f186aa60d7fbc","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是原书 Theorems 4–5 的直接推论，比旧稿要求标准模型中全部定理为真更贴近书中假设。对有限迭代作归纳：由 [[67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity]]，给 $\\Sigma_1$ 可靠理论加入一个真的 $\\Pi_1$ 句仍为 $\\Sigma_1$ 保守，因而仍 $\\Sigma_1$ 可靠。基步 $C_1(T)$ 由 T 的一致性为真；若 $C_n(T)$ 真，则 $T+C_n(T)$ 仍 $\\Sigma_1$ 可靠且一致，故 $C_{n+1}(T)$ 真。于是每个有限一致性迭代为真；若局部反思扩张不一致，其 $\\Pi_1$ 后果 $\\bot$ 经 Theorem 5 转移到 PA 加这些真实迭代，矛盾。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity]]"}],"outgoing":["5d04e3c8a5885c18","851cd80e64893935","b0667bf165ad62df","9f0e08fd1022847c","cd051851df5d2aa2"]}